From cf1ea2ff46ea7b1c04c025bf2afc6f060468d474 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Mager <mikemager@codeaurora.org>
Date: Sat, 13 Sep 2014 22:00:36 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Thor: add kernel configs for the various Thor display
 configurations.

Building the standard kernel configures the display for HDMI, 1080p @ 60 fps.
The following kernel configs exist for the various Thor display configurations:

  - apq8084_thor_720p_defconfig:        Dual display, 720p @ 60fps
  - apq8084_thor_720p_100_defconfig:    Dual display, 720p @ 100fps
  - apq8084_thor_svga_defconfig:        Dual display, SVGA @ 120fps
  - apq8084_thor_svga_100_defconfig:    Dual display, SVGA @ 100fps
  - apq8084_thor_hdmi_720p_defconfig:   HDMI, 720p @ 60fps

Use 'make kernel KERNEL_DEFCONFIG=[config]' to build.

Change-Id: Ia374d9d233b30f4d081dc5ad85bc91a1dad350c1
